          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiiyumgei murenikab Israel kobun Naptali, ak Aser, ak Manase tugul, ak koon Midianik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiiyokto Gideon bik koba emet komugul ne bo tulonokab Epraim, kolenji, Ochoruge, kebarge ak Midian, ak onam beek agoi Bet-bara, ak Jordan. Kiiyumgei anyun murenik tugul che bo Epraim, ak konam beek tugul kot koit Bet-bara, agot Jordan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kinam bounik aeng’ che bo Midian, Oreb ak Seeb; ak kibar Oreb eng’ ruandetab Oreb, ak kibarji Seeb ole kitue sabibuk, eng’ Seeb, ak koon Midianik: ak kiib metitab Oreb ak ne bo Seeb koipchi Gideon eng’ Jordan bitonin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.25"
            ]
          }
        }
